{
  "label": "day86",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label day86:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene hall_day",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/BGs/hall_day.png",
      "alt": "hall_day"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I decide to leave the girls to their own devices in gym class today.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Are they going to be fine on their own? Probably not. But I put Makoto in charge so, at the very least, everyone will be mostly contained.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, everybody except Futaba, that is.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Which isn't to say that she became some sort of delinquent overnight. I mean, how could she when she never even showed up to the class?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "In fact, the main reason I decided to wander the halls is to find her.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I get that gym class can be taxing when you aren’t comfortable with your body, but it's not like running away is going to do anything to change that.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Especially when consistently running away is a thing that would probably get me in trouble if any of the other staff members found out.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It's not like I don't want to help her, of course.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I just don't know how...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Especially when I don't even know where she is.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Now...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Where would I go if I didn’t want to participate in class?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse1.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah...S...Sensei...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I knew it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What...are you doing in here?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Aren’t you supposed to be in gym?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Isn’t that what I should be asking you? Why are you in the nurse’s office?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And...why isn't the nurse here?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse2.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The nurse...doesn't work on Fridays.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump futabanursex",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label futabanursex:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And I didn't really want to go to gym today, so...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I decided to...take shelter here instead. I think I'd rather be alone right now anyway.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, that sucks for you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse3.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you really going to make me go back right now? Yumi is-",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who said anything about going back? I’m just going to hang out with you in here.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse4.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...thank you. But we both know that you shouldn’t be doing that.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sometimes, it’s better to do the things that we shouldn’t do than the things we should.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that...supposed to be inspirational?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Beats me. But I’m going to hang out with you in here because I also don’t want to be bothered with teaching today.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse5.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You...don’t ever really teach during gym anyway...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or...at all anymore, now that I think about it.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you trying to start something, Futaba?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse3.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": S-Start something? Me? What would I even start?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I promise I wasn’t trying to offend you.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Too late, Futaba. I’m horribly offended. So offended that I might even have to give you what I imagine will be your first detention ever.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse6.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Will you still give me detention if I pout like this? Just look how sad I am.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse6r",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse6r.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse6r"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm sorry. I’ve just...seen Ami use that technique before and it always seems to work on you...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can't imagine that I was anywhere near as cute as she is when she does it, though...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It worked and you no longer have detention. Congratulations, Futaba.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I obviously was never going to give you detention anyway, but now I’m definitely not going to. So, yeah. Good job.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse4.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Umm...thank you? I think...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You're welcome. I think.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know...you're really hard to follow sometimes, Sensei. I feel like I...never truly understand what sort of mood you're in.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To be fair, neither do I most of the time. And I can pretty much guarantee that that won't be changing any time soon.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse6r2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse6r2.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse6r2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Good. I don't really know how I'd react if you were just...suddenly a different person.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I do. But I'm sure that me saying that is just another thing making me hard to follow.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How...would you know my reaction to that, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know, I'm just going to provide the typical cop out answer of it coming to me in a dream.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A dream? Are you the type of person to have strange dreams like that often, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not really. In fact, I barely dream at all- and most of the dreams I do have are a little too sexual to talk about in the school nurse's office.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse7.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": S...Sexual?!",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I...suppose that it is normal for men to dream of things like that...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's normal for anyone to dream of things like that. We're free to have sex with anyone we want as long as it's in our dreams, Futaba.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse8.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don't...really know how you're expecting me to reply to that, but...my dreams are typically less...umm...that?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you saying you don't dream about having sex with me? I'm offended.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse9.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I thought you didn't want to talk about this in the nurse's office?!",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "For the first time in...probably forever, Futaba lets out a shockingly loud scream.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It's so loud, in fact, that if there was anyone near the nurse's office, I imagine they would have come rushing in right away.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Thankfully, this place is located a few halls down from the actual classrooms, so we should be safe, I think.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Calm down. You want to be alone, don't you? Yelling will just draw attention.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Besides, it wouldn't be weird if you had dreams like that about me. I'm sure you've popped up in some of mine before.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse10.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why would you dream about me when there are so many other prettier girls you could be dreaming about?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You're very pretty yourself, Futaba. And you shouldn't be worried about those girls at all when you have two secret weapons tucked inside of your blazer.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Weapons? But I'm not carrying-",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse11.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yup.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse12.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You haven’t even seen them, though...What if your dreams weren't an...accurate representation?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not seeing them is precisely why I have to rely on dreams, Futaba. I am simply working with what I have.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse12r",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse12r.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse12r"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...if by some weird coincidence you did happen to see them...what then?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you mean?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean...If by some weird coincidence you saw them...and didn't have a reason to dream anymore...would your opinion of me change?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Since there’d be no more mystery left...what would happen to me?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nothing at all.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well that’s a relief...For a second, I-",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'd have to touch them first, too.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse11.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...of course.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am a simple man.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then, after you touch them-",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’d have to fuck them.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse15.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that even a thing that you can do?!",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Futaba, even if no one is around right now, you need to stop screaming.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse14.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I'm sorry, Sensei. But you just said something absolutely ridiculous.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You...seriously haven't heard of titfucking before? Boobjobs?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse16.webp",
      "alt": "futabanurse16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Were those really the best names they could come up with?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How...how does that sort of thing even work? I don't get how that could possibly feel good.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don't say it, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I could show you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabanurse15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabanurse15.webp",
